# Automatically loaded by msync.bb from the script directory.
# One exact album name or artist/album relative path per line (case-sensitive).
# Blank lines and lines starting with # (including indented comments) are ignored.
# Excluded albums are not copied; --delete removes their selected-format destination files.
# Examples (uncomment to enable):
# 1983 - Crises
# Mike Oldfield/1984 - Discovery
